    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "This exceptional second-floor, dual-aspect apartment enjoys an enviable position within one of South Dublin`s most sought-after developments, boasting uninterrupted views over the beautiful grounds of Airfield Estate while offering superb convenience to Dundrum Town Centre, the LUAS and every conceivable amenity.\r\n\r\nBeautifully presented throughout, No. 11 combines generous proportions, an abundance of natural light and a superb layout extending to approximately 70 sqm (753 sq. ft.). \r\n\r\nOn entering, the apartment immediately conveys a wonderful sense of space. A welcoming entrance hall leads to a bright and spacious living and dining room where expansive floor-to-ceiling windows flood the accommodation with natural light. The dual-aspect design, together with a private balcony, enhances the feeling of openness and creates a seamless connection with the surrounding mature landscape.\r\n\r\nThe balcony enjoys a peaceful outlook across Airfield Estate, providing the perfect setting to enjoy a morning coffee or simply relax while taking in the leafy surroundings.\r\n\r\nThe separate fully fitted kitchen is both practical and well-appointed, offering excellent storage and generous workspace while remaining conveniently connected to the main living accommodation. \r\n\r\nThere are two spacious double bedrooms, both complete with fitted wardrobes, with the principal bedroom benefiting from a fully tiled en suite shower room. A contemporary main bathroom completes the accommodation.\r\n\r\nNo. 11 is presented in excellent condition throughout and offers an outstanding opportunity for first-time buyers, downsizers and investors seeking a quality home in an established, exceptionally well-managed development.\r\n\r\nRockfield has long been recognised as one of Dundrum`s most desirable residential developments, renowned for its mature landscaped gardens, peaceful surroundings and unrivalled convenience. \r\n\r\nResidents also enjoy exclusive lifestyle benefits, including discounted membership at the neighbouring Airfield Estate and resident discounts at the on-site pharmacy, adding further value to everyday living.\r\n\r\nThe LUAS Green Line is just a short stroll away, providing swift access to Dublin City Centre and beyond. \r\n\r\nLooking to the future, the nearby Charlemont interchange will connect directly with the new MetroLink, creating a seamless journey from Dundrum to Dublin Airport and north Dublin via the LUAS and Metro network. This significant transport enhancement will further strengthen the area`s already exceptional connectivity and long-term appeal.\r\n\r\nDundrum Town Centre offers an outstanding selection of shopping, cafés, restaurants, leisure facilities and entertainment, while the nearby M50 provides excellent access to all major road networks. \r\n\r\nSandyford Business District, Beacon Hospital, Airfield Estate, Ballawley Park, Marlay Park and UCD are all within easy reach. A superb selection of highly regarded primary and secondary schools, including Wesley College, Mount Anville and St. Olaf`s National School, further enhances this outstanding location.\r\n\r\n\r\nAccommodation\r\n\r\n\r\nEntrance Hallway: 6.13m x 2.95m\r\n\r\nLiving / Dining Room: 5.97m x 7.21m (with wrap-around south-facing windows and access to balcony)\r\n\r\nKitchen: 2.15m x 1.92m\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom: 2.94m x 5.22m\r\n\r\nEn Suite: 1.70m x 1.87m\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: 2.95m x 3.54m\r\n\r\nMain Bathroom: 1.77m x 2.43m\r\n\r\nHot Press\r\n\r\nStorage Room\r\n\r\nBalcony\r\n\r\nTotal Floor Area: Approximately 70 sqm (753 sq. ft.)\r\n\r\nFeatures\r\n•Exceptional second-floor dual-aspect apartment\r\n•Approx. 70 sq.m. / 753.47 sq.ft. \r\n•Uninterrupted views overlooking Airfield Estate\r\n•Private balcony\r\n•Bright and spacious living accommodation\r\n•Floor-to-ceiling glazing maximising natural light\r\n•Two generous double bedrooms\r\n•Master bedroom with ensuite\r\n•Separate fully fitted kitchen\r\n•Gas-fired central heating\r\n•Double-glazed windows\r\n•Designated parking\r\n•Landscaped communal gardens\r\n•Well-managed development\r\n•Walking distance to Dundrum Town Centre\r\n•Minutes from Balally LUAS\r\n•Easy access to the M50, Sandyford Business District and Dublin City Centre"
      },
